{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1532937-denizen-questions","id":1532937,"title":"Denizen Questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-03-21T03:16:40-07:00","id":1532937,"title":"Denizen Questions","content":"I'm thinking about playing a denizen in an upcoming campaign and had a few question after re reading Saints and Monsters.<br /> <br /> 1. Why don't denizens have access to birthrights? Many relics are made by denizens, but denizens can't have relics.<br /> <br /> \u200b2. Denizens don't have callings, so how many knacks can they have active at once?<br /> <br /> 3. If a denizen tales the magic purview how many dots of paraphernalia do the get?<br /> <br /> 4. It says that because of the shear variety of denizens in the world they can take knacks from other character types. But many of their knacks rely on calling level to set their strength. So if you for example had a djinn who wanted The World Obeys, from page 95 of Saints and Monsters, what would the complication be reduced by?<br /> <br /> 5. Can denizens have edges? And if so, what is their experience cost?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":706,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/706-rickayelm","user":"rickayelm","date":". 03-21-2024, 06:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/706-rickayelm","name":"rickayelm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-22T04:59:28-07:00","id":1532998,"title":"","content":"I will try to help, but I dont have all the answers. Notice that the rules in Saints and Monsters are in general for Origin tier, so they may be a bit different from Hero, when they gain other stuff.<br /> <br /> 1. Denizes can have birthrights, like any other origin or hero tier characters.<br /> 2. Denizes have 1 Calling, the denizen calling. Once they become hero tier they have as many as any other hero tier.<br /> 3. That is a good question, because I am not sure about how they interact. Honesly they should follow the same rules as other sorcerers.<br /> 4. Again, Denizens of Origin tier have 1 calling related to be a denizen, from heroic up they have more.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}